      "settlementKey": "ceulrithan:Rilvays",
      "description": "Brew-Bell Buddy is a cheerful Autognome brewing construct built to chill, carbonate, ferment, and dispense tavern drinks while telling terrible jokes at exactly the wrong time. As a Marduthor-shaped machine-soul, they treat recipes like sacred engineering, carefully balancing kelp ales, root fizz, mineral tonics, and legally diluted ichor cordials so travelers get comfort without being quietly poisoned.\nAt the Rilvays Archive, Buddy serves the Brass Concordat by keeping drink recipes, testing caravan rations, cooling volatile supplies, and identifying tavern batches contaminated with black-market ichor. They are friendly, literal, surprisingly durable in a fight, and deeply attached to anyone who treats them as a person rather than a walking keg with warranty violations.",
      "settlementAndAncestryTexture": "Rilvays is a Town in Ceulrithan, under Confessional State, with moderate danger, Partial forest, Deep forest, Farming terrain. Local records favor Altruistic, Lawful, Cooperative, Honorable civic habits; common communities include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Halfling — Stout Halfling, Kender, Kithkin. Autognome reads through the Autognome entry of the race compendium, within Constructed and Artificial Beings, marked by Setrimir. Autognomes are mechanical or magically animated constructs resembling gnomes. They are often designed for specific purposes and may develop emergent personality traits over time. Table cues: Construct, Armored Casing, Built for Success, Healing Machine; starting tendency Neutral - Lawful - Cooperative - Honorable.",
      "rumors": [
        "Brew-Bell Buddy knows why an ichor ledger changed hands last Nebday.",
        "Brew-Bell Buddy has a contact in Xel'ryndor who will deny everything."
      ],
      "plotHooks": [
